.TH EASE_LINEAR 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ease_linear \- Constant speed: returns t unchanged
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "float ease_linear(float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Constant speed: returns t unchanged. Mechanical motion, progress bars, fades where you want no acceleration.
.SH RETURN VALUE
t.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
